ports-series-21st-century","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"The oldest grudge in football","description":"When Texas Tech and its brash benefactor bought their way into the college football big time, they were settling an old West Texas score.","published":"2026-11-26T13:12:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50427039/texas-tech-puf-cody-campbell","type":"Story","byline":"Dave Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Take a 360-degree look at college football's iconic rivalry trophies","description":"Whether ancient, animal or absurd, college football's rivalry trophies take many shapes.","published":"2026-11-26T13:09:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/id/50371090/college-football-rivalry-trophies","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"USC band won't perform at UCLA football game after members vandalized campus","description":"The USC Trojan Marching Band will not perform during Saturday's rivalry game against UCLA after members of the band vandalized a portion of UCLA's campus.","published":"2026-11-26T14:39:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50600615/usc-band-perform-members-vandalized-ucla-campus","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kent State TD overturned by replay was incorrect decision, MAC says","description":"A Kent State touchdown catch should not have been overturned by replay to incomplete at the end of Tuesday's 17-12 loss to Eastern Michigan, the Mid-American Conference said Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T23:05:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50597875/kent-state-td-overturned-replay-was-incorrect-mac-says","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 College Football Playoff National Championship odds","description":"Odds and futures to win the 2027 College Football Playoff National Championship.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:57.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/47664633/2027-college-football-playoff-national-championship-odds-futures","type":"Story","byline":"Doug Greenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chris Creighton out as coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons","description":"Chris Creighton is out as head coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons with the school.","published":"2026-11-25T19:05:05.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595706/creighton-coach-eastern-michigan-13-seasons","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5084771/kj-duff","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KJ_Duff"},"pick":{"pick":32,"round":1,"team":"BUF","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"KJ Duff","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KJ_Duff","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-22T04:18:07Z","intro":"Korey \"KJ\" Duff Jr. (born December 6, 2005) is an American college football wide receiver for the Rutgers Scarlet Knights.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Duff attended St. Anthony's High School  in South Huntington, New York. In his junior season, he hauled in 44 passes for 995 yards and 12 touchdowns. Coming out of high school, Duff was rated as a four-star recruit and committed to play college football for the Rutgers Scarlet Knights over schools such as Texas A&M, Miami, Pittsburgh, Arizona State, Duke, Georgia Tech, Maryland, Syracuse, Vanderbilt, and West Virginia."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Duff made his collegiate debut in the 2024 season opener against Howard, recording one reception for nine yards in a victory. The following week against Akron, he caught two passes for 29 yards and his first collegiate touchdown, a six-yard reception from Athan Kaliakmanis, in a 49–17 victory. In Week 8 against UCLA, Duff recorded a season-high 82 receiving yards on three receptions. In the Rate Bowl against Kansas State, he caught three passes for 58 yards in a 44–41 loss. He appeared in all 13 games with four starts, finishing the season with 27 receptions for 425 yards and one touchdown.\nDuff began the 2025 season with touchdown receptions in each of his first two games, victories over Ohio and Miami (OH). In Week 3 against Norfolk State, he recorded six receptions for 119 yards. In Week 8 against Purdue, Duff had six receptions for a career-high 241 yards and one touchdown in a 27–24 victory, with his receiving total ranking second in program history for a single game. Duff finished the season with 60 receptions for 1,084 yards and seven touchdowns, starting all 12 games, and was named second-team All-Big Ten.\nIn the 2026 season opener against UMass, Duff recorded nine receptions for 196 yards and three touchdowns in a loss. In Week 2 against Boston College, Duff recorded eight receptions for 137 yards and two touchdowns. He became the first Rutgers player to record at least 120 receiving yards in three consecutive games dating back to the 2025 season. He also recorded his 100th career reception in the loss."}]}}